stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Order placed
    Pending --> Paid: Payment captured
    Pending --> Cancelled: Payment failed
    Paid --> Packing: Stock reserved
    Paid --> Refunded: Out of stock
    Packing --> Shipped: Handed to carrier
    Shipped --> Delivered: Proof of delivery
    Shipped --> Returned: Delivery failed
    Delivered --> Returned: Return requested
    Returned --> Refunded: Goods inspected
